  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EBRD Trust Fund Moldova Residential Energy Efficiency Finance Facility (MoREEFF) - EBRD Energy Eff in residential MoREECL</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Trust Fund EBRD f&#xf6;r energieffektivisering i bost&#xe4;der, Energy Facility (MoREEFF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aims to improve energy efficiency invetments in the residential       sector by increasing awareness on saving potentials and access to     soft credits from local banks. Financed in cooperation with EU/NIF    and EBRD which implements and provides a credit line to the local     banks.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till &#xf6;kade investeringar i energieffektivisering i   bost&#xe4;der genom &#xf6;kad kunskap om besparingsm&#xf6;jligheter samt tillg&#xe5;ng    till subventioner av l&#xe5;n fr&#xe5;n lokala banker. Genomf&#xf6;rs i samarbete    med EU (NIF) och EBRD som implementerar och tillhandah&#xe5;ller en        l&#xe5;negaranti till de lokala bankerna.</narrative>
  </description>
